  "description": "HTTP/2 for the ioxide io_uring runtime: framing, HPACK and flow control from nghttp2, statically linked behind a small shim with no external dependencies beyond libc. Serves HTTP/2 over any TcpConnection - h2c with prior knowledge, or h2 over TLS via ALPN - and backs the HTTP/2 client in ioxide.httpclient from the same session code. nghttp2 is sans-I/O, so ioxide keeps the ring and the loop.",
